    {
      "id": "claim_20e0cfc9f81a4b7f8b27535fb9925f3c",
      "statement": "The agent layer has two distinct orchestration paths: `ResearchLoopAgent` manages multi-iteration research work, while `TaskAgent` manages a terminal-first autonomous coding turn; specialized agents are exported as reusable building blocks alongside those orchestrators.",
