    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b6f5adf3dd8c45a7a828a4ff1b1768a7",
      "statement": "The autonomous research loop can use literature discovery, planning, implementation, experiment execution, and evaluation per iteration; literature is normally skipped after the first iteration, and optional human approval gates occur after planning, implementation, and evaluation when approval mode is enabled.",
