      "statement": "In legacy mode, `TaskAgent.run()` analyzes a repository, retrieves optional repository-memory context, plans, requests implementation, collects a diff, and conditionally runs tests; repository-analysis failure returns a failed result immediately, while planning has a rule-based fallback when the LLM is unavailable or errors.",
